name: Ground Floor
# [floor] values on wall cells make low blocks, in eighths of a wall:
# 2 = desk (0.68 m), 3 = counter (1 m). Wall types: b = executive desk,
# d = two 1980s steel desks back to back. [facing] says which way a desk's
# front (where you sit) faces. e = raised floor (gallery, steps); [ceiling] g =
# 16/8, a double-height space. See docs/GAME.md.

